{
  "spec": {
    "title": "Layout Instability API",
    "url": "https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/"
  },
  "algorithms": [
    {
      "name": "LayoutShiftAttribution node",
      "html": "",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>If <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this\" id=\"ref-for-this\">this</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#associated-node\" id=\"ref-for-associated-node\">associated node</a> is not <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/paint-timing/#exposed-for-paint-timing\" id=\"ref-for-exposed-for-paint-timing\">exposed for paint timing</a> given null, return null.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Return <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this\" id=\"ref-for-this①\">this</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#associated-node\" id=\"ref-for-associated-node①\">associated node</a>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "html": "Within the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#update-the-rendering\" id=\"ref-for-update-the-rendering\">update the rendering</a> step of the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#event-loop-processing-model\" id=\"ref-for-event-loop-processing-model\">event loop processing\nmodel</a>, a user agent implementing the Layout Instability API MUST perform the\nfollowing step after the step that invokes the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/paint-timing/#mark-paint-timing\" id=\"ref-for-mark-paint-timing\">mark paint timing</a>\nalgorithm:",
      "rationale": "for",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>For each fully active <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#document\" id=\"ref-for-document⑥\">Document</a></code> in <em>docs</em>, invoke the algorithm to\n<a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#report-the-layout-shift\" id=\"ref-for-report-the-layout-shift②\">report the layout shift</a> for that <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#document\" id=\"ref-for-document⑦\">Document</a></code>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "report the layout shift",
      "href": "https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#report-the-layout-shift",
      "html": "When asked to <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-export=\"\" id=\"report-the-layout-shift\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-report-the-layout-shift\">report the layout shift</button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-report-the-layout-shift\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"report-the-layout-shift\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-report-the-layout-shift\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-report-the-layout-shift\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'report the layout shift'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#report-the-layout-shift\" class=\"dfn-link\">#report-the-layout-shift</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#ref-for-report-the-layout-shift\">2.1. Basic Concepts</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#ref-for-report-the-layout-shift%E2%91%A0\">3. LayoutShift interface</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#ref-for-report-the-layout-shift%E2%91%A1\">5. Processing model</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=report the layout shift=]</span></div></li><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=/report the layout shift=]</span></div></li></ul></dialog> for an active\n<code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#document\" id=\"ref-for-document⑧\">Document</a></code> <var>D</var>, run the following steps:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "If the current <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#layout-shift-value\" id=\"ref-for-layout-shift-value⑤\">layout shift value</a> of <var>D</var> is not 0:",
          "rationale": "create",
          "steps": [
            {
              "html": "<p>Create a new <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#layoutshift\" id=\"ref-for-layoutshift①\">LayoutShift</a></code> object <var>newEntry</var> with <var>D</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-relevant-realm\" id=\"ref-for-concept-relevant-realm\">relevant realm</a>.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>Set <var>newEntry</var>’s <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/performance-timeline/#dom-performanceentry-name\" id=\"ref-for-dom-performanceentry-name\">name</a></code> attribute to the empty string.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>Set <var>newEntry</var>’s <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/performance-timeline/#dom-performanceentry-entrytype\" id=\"ref-for-dom-performanceentry-entrytype\">entryType</a></code> attribute to\n<code class=\"highlight\"><c- u=\"\">\"layout-shift\"</c-></code>.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>Set <var>newEntry</var>’s <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/performance-timeline/#dom-performanceentry-starttime\" id=\"ref-for-dom-performanceentry-starttime\">startTime</a></code> attribute to <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-current-high-resolution-time\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-current-high-resolution-time\">current\nhigh resolution time</a> given <var>D</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-relevant-global\" id=\"ref-for-concept-relevant-global\">relevant global object</a>.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>Set <var>newEntry</var>’s <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/performance-timeline/#dom-performanceentry-duration\" id=\"ref-for-dom-performanceentry-duration\">duration</a></code> attribute to 0.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>Set <var>newEntry</var>’s <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled idl-code\" data-dfn-for=\"LayoutShift\" data-dfn-type=\"attribute\" data-export=\"\" id=\"dom-layoutshift-value\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-dom-layoutshift-value\"><code class=\"highlight\">value</code></button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-dom-layoutshift-value\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"dom-layoutshift-value\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-dom-layoutshift-value\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-dom-layoutshift-value\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'value'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#dom-layoutshift-value\" class=\"dfn-link\">#dom-layoutshift-value</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#ref-for-dom-layoutshift-value\">3. LayoutShift interface</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>{{LayoutShift/value}}</span></div></li></ul></dialog> attribute to\nthe current <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#layout-shift-value\" id=\"ref-for-layout-shift-value⑥\">layout shift value</a> of <var>D</var>.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>Set <var>newEntry</var>’s <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled idl-code\" data-dfn-for=\"LayoutShift\" data-dfn-type=\"attribute\" data-export=\"\" id=\"dom-layoutshift-lastinputtime\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-dom-layoutshift-lastinputtime\"><code class=\"highlight\">lastInputTime</code></button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-dom-layoutshift-lastinputtime\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"dom-layoutshift-lastinputtime\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-dom-layoutshift-lastinputtime\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-dom-layoutshift-lastinputtime\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'lastInputTime'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#dom-layoutshift-lastinputtime\" class=\"dfn-link\">#dom-layoutshift-lastinputtime</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#ref-for-dom-layoutshift-lastinputtime\">3. LayoutShift interface</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#ref-for-dom-layoutshift-lastinputtime%E2%91%A0\">5.1. Report the layout shift</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>{{LayoutShift/lastInputTime}}</span></div></li></ul></dialog>\nattribute to the time of the most recent <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#excluding-input\" id=\"ref-for-excluding-input\">excluding input</a>, or 0 if\nno excluding input has occurred during the browsing session.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>Set <var>newEntry</var>’s <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled idl-code\" data-dfn-for=\"LayoutShift\" data-dfn-type=\"attribute\" data-export=\"\" id=\"dom-layoutshift-hadrecentinput\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-dom-layoutshift-hadrecentinput\"><code class=\"highlight\">hadRecentInput</code></button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-dom-layoutshift-hadrecentinput\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"dom-layoutshift-hadrecentinput\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-dom-layoutshift-hadrecentinput\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-dom-layoutshift-hadrecentinput\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'hadRecentInput'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#dom-layoutshift-hadrecentinput\" class=\"dfn-link\">#dom-layoutshift-hadrecentinput</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#ref-for-dom-layoutshift-hadrecentinput\">3. LayoutShift interface</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>{{LayoutShift/hadRecentInput}}</span></div></li></ul></dialog>\nattribute to <code class=\"highlight\"><c- kc=\"\">true</c-></code> if <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#dom-layoutshift-lastinputtime\" id=\"ref-for-dom-layoutshift-lastinputtime①\">lastInputTime</a></code> is less\nthan 500 milliseconds in the past, and <code class=\"highlight\"><c- kc=\"\">false</c-></code> otherwise.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>Set <var>newEntry</var>’s <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#dom-layoutshift-sources\" id=\"ref-for-dom-layoutshift-sources③\">sources</a></code> attribute\nto the result of invoking the algorithm to <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#report-the-layout-shift-sources\" id=\"ref-for-report-the-layout-shift-sources\">report the layout shift\nsources</a> for <var>D</var>.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p><a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/performance-timeline/#dfn-queue-a-performanceentry\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-queue-a-performanceentry\">Queue the PerformanceEntry</a>\n<var>newEntry</var> object.</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "report the layout shift sources",
      "href": "https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#report-the-layout-shift-sources",
      "html": "When asked to <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-noexport=\"\" id=\"report-the-layout-shift-sources\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-report-the-layout-shift-sources\">report the layout shift sources</button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-report-the-layout-shift-sources\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"report-the-layout-shift-sources\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-report-the-layout-shift-sources\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-report-the-layout-shift-sources\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'report the layout shift sources'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#report-the-layout-shift-sources\" class=\"dfn-link\">#report-the-layout-shift-sources</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#ref-for-report-the-layout-shift-sources\">5.1. Report the layout shift</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=report the layout shift sources=]</span></div></li><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=/report the layout shift sources=]</span></div></li></ul></dialog> for an active\n<code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#document\" id=\"ref-for-document⑨\">Document</a></code> <var>D</var>, run the following steps:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>Let <var>C</var> be an empty <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list\" id=\"ref-for-list\">list</a> of <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#node\" id=\"ref-for-node①⑦\">Node</a></code> objects.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "For each member <var>N</var> of the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#unstable-node-set\" id=\"ref-for-unstable-node-set③\">unstable node set</a> of <var>D</var>, run these steps:",
          "rationale": "if",
          "steps": [
            {
              "html": "<p>If there exists any member <var>existingNode</var> of <var>C</var> such that the\n<a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#node-impact-region\" id=\"ref-for-node-impact-region②\">node impact region</a> of <var>N</var> is a subset of the\n<a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#node-impact-region\" id=\"ref-for-node-impact-region③\">node impact region</a> of <var>existingNode</var>, then continue.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>Otherwise, if there exists any member <var>existingNode</var> of <var>C</var> such\nthat the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#node-impact-region\" id=\"ref-for-node-impact-region④\">node impact region</a> of <var>existingNode</var> is a subset\nof the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#node-impact-region\" id=\"ref-for-node-impact-region⑤\">node impact region</a> of <var>N</var>, then <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-replace\" id=\"ref-for-list-replace\">replace</a>\nthe first such member <var>existingNode</var> with <var>N</var> in <var>C</var>.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>Otherwise, if there are fewer than 5 members of <var>C</var>, then\n<a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-append\" id=\"ref-for-list-append\">append</a> <var>N</var> to <var>C</var>.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "Otherwise, run these steps:",
              "rationale": "let",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "html": "<p>Let <var>smallest</var> be the first member of <var>C</var> whose\n<a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#node-impact-region\" id=\"ref-for-node-impact-region⑥\">node impact region</a> is not greater in area than\nthe <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#node-impact-region\" id=\"ref-for-node-impact-region⑦\">node impact region</a> of any other member of <var>C</var>.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "html": "<p>If the area of the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#node-impact-region\" id=\"ref-for-node-impact-region⑧\">node impact region</a> of <var>N</var> is\ngreater than the area of the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#node-impact-region\" id=\"ref-for-node-impact-region⑨\">node impact region</a>\nof <var>smallest</var>, then\n<a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-replace\" id=\"ref-for-list-replace①\">replace</a>\n<var>smallest</var> with <var>N</var> in <var>C</var>.</p>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "html": "<p><a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-sort-in-descending-order\" id=\"ref-for-list-sort-in-descending-order\">Sort</a>\n<var>C</var> in descending order, with <var>a</var> being less than <var>b</var> if the area\nof the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#node-impact-region\" id=\"ref-for-node-impact-region①⓪\">node impact region</a> of <var>a</var> is less than the area\nof the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#node-impact-region\" id=\"ref-for-node-impact-region①①\">node impact region</a> of <var>b</var>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Return a <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-frozen-array\" id=\"ref-for-idl-frozen-array②\">FrozenArray</a></code> of <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#layoutshiftattribution\" id=\"ref-for-layoutshiftattribution④\">LayoutShiftAttribution</a></code> objects created\nby running the algorithm to <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#create-the-attribution\" id=\"ref-for-create-the-attribution①\">create the attribution</a> once\nfor each member of <var>C</var>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "create the attribution",
      "href": "https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#create-the-attribution",
      "html": "When asked to <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-noexport=\"\" id=\"create-the-attribution\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-create-the-attribution\">create the attribution</button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-create-the-attribution\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"create-the-attribution\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-create-the-attribution\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-create-the-attribution\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'create the attribution'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#create-the-attribution\" class=\"dfn-link\">#create-the-attribution</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#ref-for-create-the-attribution\">4. LayoutShiftAttribution interface</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#ref-for-create-the-attribution%E2%91%A0\">5.2. Report the layout shift sources</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=create the attribution=]</span></div></li><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=/create the attribution=]</span></div></li></ul></dialog> for a <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#node\" id=\"ref-for-node①⑧\">Node</a></code> <var>N</var>,\nrun the following steps:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>Create a new <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#layoutshiftattribution\" id=\"ref-for-layoutshiftattribution⑤\">LayoutShiftAttribution</a></code> object <var>A</var> with <var>N</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-relevant-realm\" id=\"ref-for-concept-relevant-realm①\">relevant realm</a>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Set the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#associated-node\" id=\"ref-for-associated-node②\">associated node</a> of <var>A</var> to <var>N</var>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Set the <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled idl-code\" data-dfn-for=\"LayoutShiftAttribution\" data-dfn-type=\"attribute\" data-export=\"\" id=\"dom-layoutshiftattribution-previousrect\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-dom-layoutshiftattribution-previousrect\"><code class=\"highlight\">previousRect</code></button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-dom-layoutshiftattribution-previousrect\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"dom-layoutshiftattribution-previousrect\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-dom-layoutshiftattribution-previousrect\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-dom-layoutshiftattribution-previousrect\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'previousRect'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#dom-layoutshiftattribution-previousrect\" class=\"dfn-link\">#dom-layoutshiftattribution-previousrect</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#ref-for-dom-layoutshiftattribution-previousrect\">4. LayoutShiftAttribution interface</a> <a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#ref-for-dom-layoutshiftattribution-previousrect%E2%91%A0\">(2)</a> <a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#ref-for-dom-layoutshiftattribution-previousrect%E2%91%A1\">(3)</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>{{LayoutShiftAttribution/previousRect}}</span></div></li></ul></dialog> attribute\nof <var>A</var> to the smallest <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/geometry-1/#rectangle\" id=\"ref-for-rectangle\">Rectangle</a> containing the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://wicg.github.io/layout-instability/#previous-frame-visual-representation\" id=\"ref-for-previous-frame-visual-representation②\">previous frame visual\nrepresentation</a> of <var>N</var>, in <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/cssom-view-1/#css-pixels\" id=\"ref-for-css-pixels①\">CSS pixels</a>.</p>"
        },
        {
